own ecosystem. Traffic runs. Shops are open. Neighbors go for walks. The day turns to night. NPCs have routines and requests. Complete missions for the locals, farm, earn money and souls, and spend them on upgrades that make your cat faster, louder, and harder to stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dozens of hidden secrets across the island to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701810/extras/92e5aa6748931b1e5bdce138cf4fa115.poster.avif?t=1783782937\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701810/extras/92e5aa6748931b1e5bdce138cf4fa115.webm?t=1783782937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701810/extras/92e5aa6748931b1e5bdce138cf4fa115.mp4?t=1783782937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Missions.</strong> Collect, deliver, reach, destroy, and equip your way through a layered quest chain. Nonlinear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocks.</strong> Guns, skins, accessories, items, and music tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades.</strong> Kick power, fart thrust, fire rate, and more to help you traverse, destroy, and enrich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements.</strong> For cats who need external validation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701810/extras/3b27ccb9c556a4d5d34b77ebfc783ed7.poster.avif?t=1783782937\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701810/extras/3b2